From: dArkOS RG52 Mini port
Subject: VK_EXT_robustness2 only while LSFG frame generation is on

ARMSX2 enables VK_EXT_robustness2 (nullDescriptor) on every device that
has it, for LSFG frame generation alone. On the RG52 Mini (RK3562,
Mali-G52, Arm driver g29p1) the driver then crashes in its shader compiler
(cmpbe_v2_compile_multiple_shaders) building the first convert pipeline
that reads with texelFetch (RGBA8_TO_DEPTH32, bilinear), so the GS never
starts and every game aborts at boot, on the SDL frontend and the libretro
core alike. Without the extension all 72 convert pipelines build and games
run. Ask for it only while LSFG is on, as the fp16 extension next to it is.

diff --git a/pcsx2/GS/Renderers/Vulkan/GSDeviceVK.cpp b/pcsx2/GS/Renderers/Vulkan/GSDeviceVK.cpp
index 60a219f..755e587 100644
--- a/pcsx2/GS/Renderers/Vulkan/GSDeviceVK.cpp
+++ b/pcsx2/GS/Renderers/Vulkan/GSDeviceVK.cpp
@@ -615,7 +615,11 @@ bool GSDeviceVK::SelectDeviceExtensions(ExtensionList* extension_list, bool enab
 	// LSFG frame generation only. PCSX2 targets Vulkan 1.1, where neither is core — the memory
 	// model is 1.2 and nullDescriptor never became core at all — so both come in as extensions.
 	m_optional_extensions.vk_khr_vulkan_memory_model = SupportsExtension(VK_KHR_VULKAN_MEMORY_MODEL_EXTENSION_NAME, false);
-	m_optional_extensions.vk_ext_robustness2_null_descriptor = SupportsExtension(VK_EXT_ROBUSTNESS_2_EXTENSION_NAME, false);
+	// nullDescriptor only while LSFG is on, as fp16 below: with it enabled, Mali's g29p1 driver
+	// (RK3562, Mali-G52) crashes in its shader compiler building the first convert pipeline that
+	// uses texelFetch (RGBA8_TO_DEPTH32, bilinear), so the GS never starts.
+	m_optional_extensions.vk_ext_robustness2_null_descriptor =
+		GSConfig.LsfgEnabled && SupportsExtension(VK_EXT_ROBUSTNESS_2_EXTENSION_NAME, false);
 	// LSFG's half-precision shaders, only while that option is on (the rest of the renderer has no
 	// fp16), so it takes effect from the next device, which is the next game.
 	m_optional_extensions.vk_khr_shader_float16_int8 =
